    basic: 'Keep track of the rules! The most common way to lose is forgetting a rule that was made four rounds ago. In the early game, get rid of your high-point cards (Face cards).',
    intermediate: "Rule Synergies: If there's a rule that says 'The next player draws 2 on a 7', and you hold two 7s, try to hold them until the player to your left is low on cards.",
